wake up PN532                    -> 0x55 + 0x00 * 15
SAMconfiguration [0x14]          -> set operating mode (no SAM).
InListPassiveTarget [0x4A]       -> poll for card, return UID.
InDataExchange [0x40 0x01 0x30]  -> read 16 bytes (4 pages)

Page Layout
Page 3 byte 2 = NDEF memory size / 8.
NDEF memory size / 4 = number of pages. Each read fetches 16 B (4 x 4 B pages)
NDEF memory defines memory size beginning at page 4. 0-3 contain